<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 22px; color: #222; line-height: 1.6; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 .3em; }
  .sub { color: #777; margin: 0 0 1.4em; }
  .box { background: #f4f4f4; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 14px 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: inherit; }
  .cap { color: #888; font-size: .82rem; margin-top: .5em; }
  a { color: #b5341f; }
  img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 1em; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Ready to post &mdash; &ldquo;{{ post_title }}&rdquo;</h1>
  <p class="sub">The post is live: <a href="{{ post_url }}">{{ post_url }}</a></p>

  <p>Copy the teaser below and paste it into Facebook / Threads. Save the photo
  underneath (long-press on phone, right-click on desktop) and attach it to the post.</p>

  <div class="box">{{ teaser_text }}</div>

  {% if teaser_image %}
  <p style="margin-top:1.6em"><strong>Photo</strong> &mdash; direct link:
    <a href="{{ teaser_image.url }}">{{ teaser_image.url }}</a></p>
  <img src="{{ teaser_image.src }}" alt="{{ teaser_image.alt }}">
  <div class="cap">{{ teaser_image.attribution_html | safe }}</div>
  {% endif %}
</body>
</html>
